> References

- [He et al. (2020), Momentum Contrast for Unsupervised Visual Representation Learning](https://arxiv.org/abs/1911.05722).
- [Chen et al. (2020), Improved Baselines with Momentum Contrastive Learning](https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.04297).
- [Chen et al. (2021), An Empirical Study of Training Self-Supervised Vision Transformers](https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.02057).
